	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  ERROR: operator does not exist: character varying = integer]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=12844#p12844"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>voulez vous m&#039;informer SVP s&#039;il y a un moyen de modifier cette command de sorte que soit accepter par tout mes serveur le 8.1 et 9.0<br />int PSQL_GetCertificat(char no_serie[], char *typecert)<br />{<br />&#160; &#160; int status;<br />&#160; &#160; char command[400];<br />&#160; &#160; PGresult *result;&#160; <br />&#160; &#160; int nbTuples;<br />&#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; Fmt(command,&quot;%s&lt;%s%s&quot;,&quot;SELECT typecertificat FROM mac WHERE infodht_no_serie=&quot;,no_serie);<br />&#160; &#160; result = PQexec(db, command);<br />&#160; &#160; status = VerifyCmdWithData(result);</p>]]></content>
